;
; Filename: MPGmacro4.mac
; Description: ATC Reset -- wireless MPG Aux Key 4
; Requires: CNC12; tools 199 and 200 assigned the same bin in the Tool Library
;
; CNC12 runs this file for wireless MPG macro button 4 (the PLC also requests it
; via MpgMacro4_M -> SV_SYS_MACRO = 4). Per the CNC12 operator manual the code
; must sit between N100 and N1000, and the stock M225 example message must be
; gone -- that popup is what a stock/unedited MPGmacro4.mac shows.
;
; The reset action itself lives in mfunc20.mac (M20), shared with the VCP
; ATC RESET button, so there is one source of truth. See that file for why a
; dummy tool is needed and why there are two of them.
;
IF #50001                        ; Prevent lookahead from parsing past here
IF #4201 || #4202 THEN GOTO 1000 ; Skip macro if graphing or searching
N100                             ; ---- code must live between N100 and N1000 ----
M20                              ; ATC Reset
N1000                            ; End of Macro
